Description: KWin effect that rounds all four window corners
 KDE Rounded Corners by Matin Lotfaliei, built for Kernora OS. It rounds
 the bottom corners of windows as well as the top, draws a soft shadow
 that follows the rounded shape, and leaves maximised, tiled and full
 screen windows square. Kernora sets its radius, shadow and outline in
 /etc/xdg/kwinrc.
